<title>CANADA: TABLE-Canada government cash balances fall in week.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Canada government cash balances fall in week.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of Canada's cash balances fell in the week that ended Aug 13, the Bank of Canada said on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Wk to Aug 13  Chg on wk Chg on yr</p>
<p>Notes in circulation		  28.42   -0.503    +1.209</p>
<p>Government cash balances	     5.45   -2.536    +0.180</p>
<p>Govt securities outstanding	454.60   -3.530    -6.392</p>
<p>Treasury bills			 118.60   -3.500   -35.200</p>
<p>Canada savings bonds		  32.06   -0.028    +1.911</p>
<p>All figures in billions of dollars.</p>
</text>
